<?xml version="1.0"?>
<config xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
        xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="urn:magento:module:Magento_Config:etc/system_file.xsd">
    <system>
        <tab id="conversionwax" translate="label" sortOrder="420">
            <label>ConversionWax</label>
        </tab>
        <section id="conversionwax_lastmile"
                 translate="label"
                 type="text"
                 sortOrder="10"
                 showInDefault="1"
                 showInWebsite="1"
                 showInStore="1">
            <label>Last Mile</label>
            <tab>conversionwax</tab>
            <resource>Cwax_Banner::lastmile_config</resource>
            <group id="connection"
                   translate="label"
                   type="text"
                   sortOrder="10"
                   showInDefault="1"
                   showInWebsite="1"
                   showInStore="1">
                <label>Connection</label>
                <field id="enabled"
                       translate="label comment"
                       type="select"
                       sortOrder="10"
                       showInDefault="1"
                       showInWebsite="1"
                       showInStore="1">
                    <label>Enabled</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>Cart, checkout, login and order events are added to Magento's queue during storefront requests. Network delivery runs only in the queue consumer.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="web_property_id"
                       translate="label comment"
                       type="text"
                       sortOrder="20"
                       showInDefault="1"
                       showInWebsite="1"
                       showInStore="1">
                    <label>ConversionWax Website ID</label>
                    <validate>required-entry validate-length minimum-length-36 maximum-length-36</validate>
                    <comment>Copy the 36-character Website ID from Last Mile tracking settings in ConversionWax. A value of the wrong length is rejected at save time; this catches a truncated or partial paste, but it cannot confirm the ID matches the intended website.</comment>
                    <depends>
                        <field id="enabled">1</field>
                    </depends>
                </field>
                <field id="integration_id"
                       translate="label comment"
                       type="text"
                       sortOrder="25"
                       showInDefault="1"
                       showInWebsite="1"
                       showInStore="1">
                    <label>Integration ID</label>
                    <backend_model>Cwax\Banner\Model\Config\Backend\IntegrationId</backend_model>
                    <comment>Copy it from the Embed code tab of this Magento install in ConversionWax (data-cwax-integration-id). Until it is set, Magento adds no Last Mile tag to the storefront, so page and product views are not tracked. Cart, checkout, login and order events do not need it.</comment>
                    <depends>
                        <field id="enabled">1</field>
                    </depends>
                </field>
                <field id="api_token"
                       translate="label comment"
                       type="obscure"
                       sortOrder="30"
                       showInDefault="1"
                       showInWebsite="1"
                       showInStore="1">
                    <label>Connection Token</label>
                    <backend_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Backend\Encrypted</backend_model>
                    <comment>Generate this one-time token in ConversionWax. Magento stores it encrypted.</comment>
                    <depends>
                        <field id="enabled">1</field>
                    </depends>
                </field>
                <field id="environment"
                       translate="label comment"
                       type="select"
                       sortOrder="40"
                       showInDefault="1"
                       showInWebsite="1"
                       showInStore="1">
                    <label>Environment</label>
                    <source_model>Cwax\Banner\Model\Config\Source\Environment</source_model>
                    <comment>Use Production for live stores. Choose Staging only when ConversionWax support asks you to test against the ConversionWax staging service.</comment>
                    <depends>
                        <field id="enabled">1</field>
                    </depends>
                </field>
                <field id="storefront_snippet"
                       translate="label comment"
                       type="select"
                       sortOrder="50"
                       showInDefault="1"
                       showInWebsite="1"
                       showInStore="1">
                    <label>Load Last Mile on Magento storefront</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>Yes adds the Last Mile browser snippet (lm.js) to every storefront page, on Luma and Hyva themes, for page and product views. Choose No only when another front end (for example a headless storefront) already loads its own lm.js for this website. Cart, checkout, login and order events are sent either way. Flush the cache after you change this.</comment>
                    <depends>
                        <field id="enabled">1</field>
                    </depends>
                </field>
            </group>
        </section>
    </system>
</config>
